{'symbol': 'PRU', 'date': '2021-07-22 13:49:00', 'title': 'AM BEST PLACES CREDIT RATINGS OF PRUDENTIAL RETIREMENT INSURANCE AND ANNUITY COMPANY UNDER REVIEW WITH POSITIVE IMPLICATIONS', 'text': "OLDWICK, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #INSURANCE--AM BEST HAS PLACED UNDER REVIEW WITH POSITIVE IMPLICATIONS THE FINANCIAL STRENGTH RATING OF A+ (SUPERIOR) AND THE LONG-TERM ISSUER CREDIT RATING OF “AA-” (SUPERIOR) OF PRUDENTIAL RETIREMENT INSURANCE AND ANNUITY COMPANY (PRIAC), HEADQUARTERED IN NEWARK, NJ. PRIAC'S CREDIT RATINGS (RATINGS) WERE PLACED UNDER REVIEW WITH POSITIVE IMPLICATIONS FOLLOWING THE ANNOUNCEMENT THAT EMPOWER RETIREMENT (LEGALLY KNOWN AS GREAT-WEST LIFE & ANNUITY INSURANCE COMPANY) AND PR"}